<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Groundwork Labs — Post From Your Phone</title>
<style>
  :root{--bg:#0C0B09;--surface:#161411;--line:#2A261F;--text:#F2EFEA;--muted:#9C948A;--faint:#6A6157;--ochre:#E8A33D}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;padding:28px 18px 80px}
  .wrap{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto}
  h1{font-size:34px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .rule{width:80px;height:3px;background:var(--ochre);margin:18px 0 14px}
  p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.6}
  .step{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;margin-top:22px}
  .step h2{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--ochre);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}
  .step img{width:100%;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);display:block}
  .hint{font-size:13px;color:var(--faint);margin-top:8px}
  .cap{background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text);white-space:pre-wrap;margin-top:14px}
  .tags{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--faint);margin-top:10px;word-break:break-word}
  button{width:100%;margin-top:10px;padding:14px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--ochre);background:transparent;color:var(--ochre);font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.04em}
  button:active{background:var(--ochre);color:#0C0B09}
  .bio{border-left:3px solid var(--ochre);padding-left:14px;margin-top:12px;color:var(--text);font-size:15px;line-height:1.7}
  a{color:var(--ochre)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1>Groundwork Labs</h1>
  <div class="rule"></div>
  <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">Launch from your phone, top to bottom.</strong> For each step: press &amp; hold the image → <em>Save to Photos / Download image</em>, then tap <em>Copy caption</em> and paste it into Instagram. Put the hashtags in the first comment (button for that too).</p>

  <div class="step">
    <h2>Step 0 — Profile</h2>
    <img src="assets/profile-picture.png" alt="Profile picture" loading="lazy">
    <p class="hint">Save this → Instagram → Edit profile → change photo. Then paste the bio:</p>
    <div class="bio">Business systems studio.<br>Websites, custom apps &amp; AI automation for service businesses.<br>Fewer spreadsheets. More Sundays off.<br>↓ DM "SYSTEMS" for a free 15-min audit</div>
    <button onclick="cp(this,`Business systems studio.\nWebsites, custom apps & AI automation for service businesses.\nFewer spreadsheets. More Sundays off.\n↓ DM "SYSTEMS" for a free 15-min audit`)">Copy bio</button>
  </div>

  <div id="posts"></div>

  <div class="step">
    <h2>After all nine are up</h2>
    <p>1. Open the middle post (Groundwork Labs manifesto) → tap ⋯ → <strong style="color:var(--text)">Pin to profile</strong>.<br><br>
    2. Reply to every comment and DM. When someone DMs "SYSTEMS": ask what they do + their most annoying weekly task, then offer two times for a 15-minute call.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
function cp(btn, txt){
  navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt).then(()=>{ const o=btn.textContent; btn.textContent="Copied ✓"; setTimeout(()=>btn.textContent=o,1600); });
}
const posts = [
 ["post-09","Upload 1 of 9 — the slow quote",
`A quote that takes three days loses to a quote that takes three minutes. Not because it's better — because it was first.

We build systems that price jobs from your real rates and send a clean, professional quote while the other guys are still "getting back to them".

Fast quotes win work. It's the cheapest growth there is.

DM the word SYSTEMS for a free 15-minute systems audit — we'll map where your hours are leaking and send you one page of fixes. No pitch, no jargon.`,
`#smallbusinessaustralia #sydneybusiness #businesssystems #quoting #tradebusiness #customsoftware #servicebusiness #businessautomation #smallbusinessowner #winmorework`],
 ["post-08","Upload 2 of 9 — the business in your head",
`If you took a week off tomorrow, could anyone run things without calling you?

Prices, job history, that one supplier's number — when it all lives in your head, you don't own a business. You're wearing one.

We build systems that hold what you're holding: every job, every client, every price, findable by anyone you trust.

DM the word SYSTEMS and we'll show you what your business looks like with a memory.`,
`#businesssystems #smallbusinessaustralia #businessowner #sydneysmallbusiness #operations #customsoftware #delegation #servicebusiness #worklifebalance #businessgrowth`],
 ["post-07","Upload 3 of 9 — the double booking",
`Every double-booking costs you twice: the customer you reshuffled, and the one who watched you do it.

We build booking systems that confirm appointments, send the reminders, and guard your calendar while you're working. No more Saturday surprises. No more "sorry — when did we say?"

The paper diary had a good run.

DM the word SYSTEMS to fix it.`,
`#bookings #smallbusinessaustralia #sydneybusiness #appointmentbooking #businesssystems #noshows #servicebusiness #businessautomation #customsoftware #smallbusinesstips`],
 ["post-06","Upload 4 of 9 — the weekly ritual",
`Every business has one — the job you redo every single week and stopped questioning years ago.

The roster. The stocktake. The team lists. The reminder messages.

One of our recent builds turned a 45-minute weekly ritual into a single tap. Forty-five minutes a week, forever — that's more than a full working week handed back every year.

What's yours? DM the word SYSTEMS and tell us. We collect these.`,
`#automation #smallbusinessaustralia #productivity #businesssystems #sydneybusiness #timesaving #aiautomation #customsoftware #businessowner #workflow`],
 ["post-05","Upload 5 of 9 — THE MANIFESTO (pin this)",
`Groundwork Labs is a business systems studio.

We design and build custom websites, apps and AI automations for businesses that run on memory, paper and late nights — and shouldn't have to.

Everything we post here is a real problem we've solved: real screens, real workflows, real hours handed back.

No stock photos. No buzzwords. We do the groundwork; your business runs on it.

DM the word SYSTEMS for a free 15-minute systems audit. The first 15 minutes is on us.`,
`#businesssystems #customsoftware #webdesignsydney #appdevelopment #aiautomation #sydneybusiness #smallbusinessaustralia #softwarestudio #servicebusiness #groundworklabs`],
 ["post-04","Upload 6 of 9 — the DMs client list",
`Bookings in the chat. Payments "sorted later". Notes in your head at 11pm.

Running clients through your DMs works brilliantly — right up until it doesn't. Someone slips through, someone doesn't pay, and you've become the app.

We build one screen that holds it all: who's booked, who's paid, who needs a nudge — and the nudge sends itself.

DM the word SYSTEMS if your business lives in your message requests.`,
`#clientmanagement #smallbusinessaustralia #coachingbusiness #bookingsystem #businesssystems #sydneybusiness #customapp #getpaid #servicebusiness #businessautomation`],
 ["post-03","Upload 7 of 9 — the same question, 40 times",
`"Are you open?" "How much is it?" "Is it still available?"

Great questions — the fortieth time before lunch, less so.

We build screens that answer them for you: live availability, clear prices, order-ahead. Your customers get instant answers. You get your day back.

DM the word SYSTEMS if your phone keeps answering questions a screen should.`,
`#smallbusinessaustralia #sydneysmallbusiness #onlineordering #liveavailability #businesssystems #webdesignsydney #customsoftware #retailtech #hospitalitybusiness #shoplocal`],
 ["post-02","Upload 8 of 9 — the missed call",
`Here's what a missed call actually costs: the customer doesn't leave a voicemail. They ring the next name on Google.

We build systems that text back within seconds — "Sorry we missed you, what does the job need?" — take the details, and draft the quote from your real price list. You approve one message when you're free.

You were at dinner the whole time.

DM the word SYSTEMS to stop losing the after-hours work.`,
`#missedcalls #aiautomation #smallbusinessaustralia #tradebusiness #sydneybusiness #aiforbusiness #businessautomation #leadgeneration #businesssystems #afterhours`],
 ["post-01","Upload 9 of 9 (LAST) — the 10pm invoice",
`The 10pm invoice shift. Every owner knows it.

The work's done, the house is quiet, and you're typing invoices with one eye open. That's not admin — that's a second job you don't get paid for.

We build systems that invoice the moment a job's marked done, then follow up politely so you never have to be the bad guy.

Keep the evening. DM the word SYSTEMS for a free 15-minute systems audit.`,
`#invoicing #smallbusinessaustralia #tradiesofaustralia #sydneybusiness #getpaidfaster #businesssystems #businessautomation #customsoftware #cashflow #smallbusinessowner`],
];
document.getElementById("posts").innerHTML = posts.map(p=>`
  <div class="step">
    <h2>${p[1]}</h2>
    <img src="assets/${p[0]}.png" alt="${p[0]}" loading="lazy">
    <p class="hint">Press &amp; hold the image → Save. Then:</p>
    <div class="cap">${p[2]}</div>
    <button onclick='cp(this,${JSON.stringify(p[2]).replace(/'/g,"&#39;")})'>Copy caption</button>
    <div class="tags">${p[3]}</div>
    <button onclick='cp(this,${JSON.stringify(p[3]).replace(/'/g,"&#39;")})'>Copy hashtags (first comment)</button>
  </div>`).join("");
</script>
</body>
</html>
